              <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
                You typically continue with one 50-minute session per week. Fortnightly sessions may be more suitable for some clients. Each session builds on the last; the process is cumulative.
              </p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="text-xs bg-sage/20 text-primary px-3 py-1 rounded-full">1 session/week (recommended)</span>
